{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Wishlist Blightened</strong> and survive the corruption when the cycle begins!<br>game where corruption (blight) is both your weapon and your curse. Wield unstable <strong><i>blight</i></strong> energy, explore fractured realms, and overcome monstrous guardians in a world lost to time and reality. <br> <br><strong>Core Genre Tags:</strong> Metroidvania \u2022 2.5D Action Platformer \u2022 Dark Fantasy</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd11 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Blight as a Weapon</strong> \u2013 Fuel your attacks and abilities with blight, a volatile force that grows stronger and more unstable the deeper you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Reality-Bending Exploration</strong> \u2013 Traverse ruptures in time where environments shift and mutate as your corruption deepens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddec <strong>Unlock the Past</strong> \u2013 Discover relics, whispers, and corrupted memories scattered across ruins frozen in collapsing timelines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddca <strong>Hand-Crafted Realms</strong> \u2013 Journey through frozen wastelands, fungal tombs, and ancient sanctuaries lost beyond time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddb4 <strong>Monstrous Combat</strong> \u2013 Face brutal enemies like the Mountain Fist Golem in high-speed, precision-driven battles.   <br>  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/BossFight2.gif?t=1751343938\" /></div></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/SwampDigAttack.gif?t=1751343938\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared